This project does not redistribute any model weights or dataset audio. They are
downloaded at runtime and remain subject to their own licenses:

  openai/whisper-small.en
      MIT License. OpenAI Whisper, Radford et al. (2022).

  superb/wav2vec2-base-superb-er
      Apache License 2.0. SUPERB benchmark, Yang et al. (2021);
      built on wav2vec 2.0, Baevski et al. (2020).

  bhadresh-savani/distilbert-base-uncased-emotion
      Apache License 2.0. DistilBERT, Sanh et al. (2019);
      fine-tuned checkpoint published by Bhadresh Savani.

  audeering/wav2vec2-large-robust-12-ft-emotion-msp-dim   (optional)
      CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — non-commercial use only. The pipeline runs without it;
      keep MMSA_DIMENSIONAL=0 if the deployment is commercial.

  RAVDESS — Ryerson Audio-Visual Database of Emotional Speech and Song
      CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Livingstone & Russo (2018), DOI 10.5281/zenodo.1188976.
      Not redistributed here. Up to six short excerpts may be extracted into
      demo_samples/ for demonstration, with attribution, under the same
      non-commercial share-alike terms.

The synthetic clips in demo_samples/ are generated by this project's own script
and carry no third-party rights.
